   "id": "nb",
   "x": 70,
   "y": 852,
   "text": "It shows MORE buffer hits after indexing: the planner drops the hash join for a nested loop that probes\nthe index 5,000 times. Wall-clock still falls 2.2x, but the buffer counter moves the wrong way.",
